Looking at this problem, I need to find $g: \mathbb{Z}^+ \to \mathbb{Z}^+$ with:
1. $\gcd(g(m), g(n)) \geq (\gcd(m,n))^{2014}$ for all $m, n \in \mathbb{Z}^+$
2. $n - 2014 \leq g(n) \leq n$ for all $n \in \mathbb{Z}^+$

